\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:100px;height:20px;font-size:10px;line-height:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box\">디엔비레 상세 정보</div>\n<div data-type=\"scaffold-block\" data-variant=\"text\" class=\"scaffold-block\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0.0px;top:0.0px;width:40.0px;height:14.0px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;color:#334155;overflow:hidden;\" class=\"scaffold-block scaffold-block-text\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:100px;height:20px;font-size:10px;line-height:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box\"><p style=\"margin:0;\">디엔비레 제품은 당뇨병과 혈류를 개선하는 안전한 치료제로서, 천연 나노기술로 가공하여 천연 물질의 특성과 활성성분을 손상시키지 않고 제조하여 바이오 가용성을 극대화하는 천연 나노기술로 독특하게 생산된 당뇨병과 혈류를 개선하는 안전한 치료제입니다.</p></div>\n<div data-type=\"scaffold-block\" data-variant=\"text\" class=\"scaffold-block\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0.0px;top:0.0px;width:40.0px;height:14.0px;font-size:10.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#334155;\" class=\"scaffold-block scaffold-block-text\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:100px;height:20px;font-size:10px;line-height:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;box-sizing:border-box\"><span style=\"font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;\">유효성분:</span> <span data-type=\"scaffold-slot\" class=\"scaffold-slot\" data-slot-id=\"s10\" data-mapping-num=\"10\" data-placeholder=\"유효성분\"></span></div>\n<div data-type=\"scaffold-block\" data-variant=\"text\" class=\"scaffold-block\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0.0px;top:0.0px;width:40.0px;height:14.0px;font-size:10.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;color:#334155;\" class=\"scaffold-block scaffold-block-text\" style=\"position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:100px;height:20px;font-size:10px;line-height:1;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-